        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Reports intermittent bloating and occasional brief headaches; prior dizziness and indigestion were brief and self-limiting. Patient worries these symptoms might be cancer or indicate rapidly worsening dementia."
      }
    },
    {
