        "valueString": "Cooperative and mildly restless; maintains eye contact. Speech normal in rate and volume, slightly pressured when discussing health worries, with repetitive 'what if it's cancer' statements. Mood described as 'worried'; affect anxious, congruent and reactive. Thought form linear but perseverative on health worries. Prominent health concerns about cancer and dementia; no delusions or suicidal ideation. Insight and judgement: acknowledges being anxious and is appropriately help-seeking."
